        {
          "id": 3626393492,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "That won't cause a run-time problem - if `rec_length_remaining` is < `sizeof buffer`, `bytes_to_read` will be equal to `rec_length_remaining` - but the code might be clearer if we do the above.\n\n...as indicated by the fact that it took some additional reading and analyzing for me to determine that.",
